Demonstrates MULTIPLE_DEFAULT_COMMODITIES using a complete journal.

========== API ==========

accounts({})

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
  default
commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
  default

========== WARNINGS ==========

[MULTIPLE_DEFAULT_COMMODITIES] Multiple commodity declarations are marked default; using the first at {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:3:3
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:6:3
